    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it only lasted two minutes and i feel completely normal now. i dont really want to sit in an ER waiting room for 6 hours if there isnt actually anything wrong. honestly it was probably just a weird migraine or something, don't you think? like, if it doesn't happen again, is it really worth the trip?",
