    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just don't see why it's an emergency if it's already over. if it was something serious like a stroke, wouldnt i still be feeling it right now? it seems way more likely i'm just stressed or tired. can you just tell me straight, is this actually dangerous or am i just overreacting? i really just want to know if i can just sleep on it and see how i feel in the morning.",
